sequenceDiagram
 participant G as Generator
 participant T as Lossy transport
 participant W as Worker
 participant E as Engine
 participant L as WAL
 G->>T: operation(op_id, trace_id)
 alt packet dropped
 T-->>G: no delivery / retry with jitter
 else delivered
 T->>W: operation
 W->>E: process(operation)
 E->>E: validate + idempotency check
 E->>L: append record + fsync
 L-->>E: durable append
 E->>E: apply state transition
 E-->>W: committed result
 W-->>G: result + attempt count
 end
